  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Pacific Fisheries (SPF)- Western and Central Pacific Fisheries Commission (WCPFC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To engage with Secretariat of the Pacific Community (SPC) on Sustainable Pacific Fisheries (SPF) Monitoring, Evaluation, Research and Learning (MERL), partnerships framework, etc. Under SPF, technically&#xA0;responsible for actions including:
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Coordinating Western Pacific East Asia Sustainable Tuna Data Monitoring support to Indonesia, Philippines and Viet Nam.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Support sustainable fisheries management of yellowfin tuna in Indonesian archipelagic waters, focused on juvenile stock.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
